        \uD5C8\uAC00\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1845934897413890013, guid: fad4957d8e1bdf24cbdc8c59ec7a5d55, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allChoices.Array.data[8].description
      value: "\uBCFC \uAE30\uD68C\uB97C 2\uD68C \uB354 \uC5BB\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n(\uC2A4\uD14C\uC774\uC9C0
